contentText:
During Tuesday night&#8217;s (March 31) Broadway production of Moulin Rouge! The Musical , Megan Thee Stallion was taken to the hospital after she started feeling sick, Billboard has confirmed.

According to a statement from Megan&#8217;s team sent to Billboard : “During Tuesday night’s production, Megan started feeling very ill and was promptly transported to a local hospital, where her symptoms are currently being evaluated. We will share additional updates as more information becomes available.”

